      "codigoOriginal": "Local llOks\n\nllOks = .t.\nIf Not ThisForm.poDataMgr.Update([crSigOpArq])\n\t=MessageBox([Favor Reinicializar o Processo!!!], 16, [Falha na Conexão (Update - crSigOpArq)])\n\tllOks = .f.\nEndIf\n\nIf llOks And (ThisForm.poDataMgr.Commit() < 1)\n\t=MessageBox([Favor Reinicializar o Processo!!!], 16, [Falha na Conexão (Commit)])\n\tllOks = .f.\nEndIf\n\nIf Not llOks\n\tThisForm.poDataMgr.RollBack()\nEndIf\n\nReturn llOks\n* Fim ********************************************************************************* ",
